*        TRANSLATE ynet USING  '.,'.

        REPLACE ALL OCCURRENCES OF '.000' IN peinhx WITH ''.

        MOVE peinhx  TO peinh.
        MOVE ynet    TO dbl_price.
        WRITE peinhx TO peinhx2.

        CONDENSE peinhx2 NO-GAPS.

        MOVE peinhx2 TO str_priceunit.

      ELSE.

        dbl_price       = price.                            "ES17042015
        str_priceunit   = priceunit.                        "ES17042015

      ENDIF.

    ENDIF.

